# Copy to .env (optional: inside a served pack every setting below has a default). Paths on the serving box.

# The model, as in the first recipe: a directory (config.json, model.safetensors.index.json, the
# model-*.safetensors shards, tokenizer files) or a Hugging Face repo id, which is fetched into
# <recipe>/models/<org>__<name>. Either the raw 2.9 bpw quant (converted and assembled on the first run)
# or an already served pack (as hosted on Hugging Face: nothing to convert). One-off: ./serve.sh --model <dir | org/name>.
# Unset when this recipe sits inside a served pack (<pack>/recipe): the pack is then the parent directory.
# MODEL=/home/max/models/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-2.9bpw
# diffbot's pack download: recipe/ (image build, serve.sh, patches, kernel sources, plans) is what is used.
# Default <recipe>/diffbot, where prepare_pack.py fetches their recipe/ (a few MB) when it is missing.
# DIFFBOT=/home/max/models/diffbot/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-EXL3-3bpw-2x-RTX-PRO-6000
# DIFFBOT_REV=main   # revision of diffbot's repo to fetch recipe/ from
# diffbot's int4 Engram shards model-00047/48-of-00048.safetensors (~103 GiB). Looked for in the pack, then
# here, then the DIFFBOT folder; fetched from diffbot's repo into ENGRAM_DIR (or DIFFBOT) when nobody has them.
# ENGRAM_DIR=/home/max/DeepSeek-v4.1-Flash-EXL3-2x-RTX6000Pro/engram-int4
# Where prepare_pack.py assembles the served pack from a raw quant. Default: <quant dir>-served, next to the
# quant (same filesystem -> the unchanged shards are hardlinks; ~17 GB of rewritten shards + 7.4 GB drafter).
# PACK=/home/max/models/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-2.9bpw-served
# Stock DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 drafter shards 44-46 (7.4 GiB), fetched here if missing (raw quant only).
# STOCK_DRAFTER=/home/max/models/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-drafter
# diffbot's serving image (built with their recipe/docker/build.sh when missing) and the plan to derive ours from.
# IMAGE=dsv41-flash-1017-exl3-3bpw-sm120
# DIFFBOT_PLAN=plan-1017-agent30-c512.json

# --- serve.sh ---
# API_KEY=change-me          # unset = no authentication
# SERVED=deepseek-v4.1-flash-2.9bpw
# PORT=8000
# diffbot's knobs you may want to change (see their recipe/serve/serve.sh): MAX_MODEL_LEN, KV_MEM,
# MAX_NUM_SEQS, SPEC_K, CPU_EXPERTS. VRAM is tighter than with their pack only if KV_MEM is raised.
# MAX_MODEL_LEN=1048576
# KV_MEM=4563402752
# SPEC_K=5
# CPU_EXPERTS=0
